## Idea 8 Gold Bay
- Requirement is old (RBI 2013 NBFC circular: no branch without storage/vault) so entrants already know how to build; SBI tender sizing 100-150 sq ft strong room RCC to IS 15369. No published cost.
- Entrants buy branches/licences rather than build: L&T–Paul Merchants 130 branches (Rs 537 cr), InCred–TruCap 115 branches, Tata–Yogakshemam, Godrej–Kanakadurga. Muthoot guides 200-300 new branches FY27.
- Commodity fit-out: Godrej Security Solutions. $100M = 10,300 bays at ~$9.7k (pool admits ~100% of entrant wave). Verdict KILL. median $3M upside $25M.

